,"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"La storia di Souleymane","overview":"Souleymane ha origini guineane ma abita a Parigi e si guadagna da vivere consegnando cibo in bicicletta. Ora ha solo due giorni di tempo per prepararsi alla perfezione e superare il colloquio di richiesta asilo: il problema è che ha deciso di raccontare una storia che non è la sua."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Souleymane's Story","overview":"As he pedals through the streets of Paris to deliver meals, Souleymane recounts his story. In two days, he has to go through his asylum application interview, the key to obtaining papers, but Souleymane is not ready."},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"Tandis qu’il pédale dans les rues de Paris pour livrer des repas, Souleymane répète son histoire. Dans deux jours, il doit passer son entretien de demande d’asile, le sésame pour obtenir des papiers. Mais Souleymane n’est pas prêt."}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dsHRdKmN0r3JkFofXndYyNhzjZf.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dsHRdKmN0r3JkFofXndYyNhzjZf.png","language":"en","width":1472,"height":523},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dyJDcrvoNZh6fhINjODvCN4kBRo.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dyJDcrvoNZh6fhINjODvCN4kBRo.png","language":"xx","width":660,"height":163},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kdOCd8Yz8ND91epOzNtWmRAErXr.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kdOCd8Yz8ND91epOzNtWmRAErXr.png","language":"fr","width":1850,"height":614}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/g2LtoRQKLBWdGfvK943yAhNo1Vj.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/g2LtoRQKLBWdGfvK943yAhNo1Vj.jpg","language":"it","width":1497,"height":2245},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4bzwgHOnhjvVbL0b0YtUsuuOMBx.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4bzwgHOnhjvVbL0b0YtUsu